msgid "Chooses vehicle learning or a manual override. Force off takes priority;"
msgstr "車両の学習または手動の上書きを選択します。オフの強制が優先されます。"

#: openpilot/starpilot/ui/torque_feature.py
msgid "Chooses vehicle learning or a manual override. Force off takes priority; Force auto temporarily ignores saved factor, friction and ratio."
msgstr "車両の学習または手動の上書きを選択します。オフの強制が優先されます。自動の強制では、保存済みの係数、摩擦、比率を一時的に無視します。"

#: openpilot/starpilot/galaxy/web/js/settings.js
msgid "Close page search"
msgstr "ページ内検索を閉じる"

#: openpilot/starpilot/galaxy/web/js/toggle-search.js
msgid "Close search"
msgstr "検索を閉じる"

#: openpilot/starpilot/galaxy/web/js/flm-training-results.js
